{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: Agent基础概念MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent 的工作循环是怎样的？请描述感知→规划→执行→反思的完整流程\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent基础概念\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> fundamental\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/基础概念\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/fundamental</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Agent 完成任务的完整工作循环是什么？请详细描述感知（Perception）→ 规划（Planning）→ 执行（Execution）→ 反思（Reflection）各阶段的工作内容和数据流转。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Agent 的核心工作循环是一个<strong>持续迭代的闭环系统</strong>，模拟人类解决问题的方法：先观察、再思考、后行动、最后复盘。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>完整流程图：</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                     Agent 工作循环                            │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n  ┌──────────┐    ┌──────────┐    ┌──────────┐    ┌──────────┐\n  │  感知     │ → │  规划     │ → │  执行     │ → │  反思     │\n  │Perception│    │ Planning │    │ Execution│    │Reflection│\n  └────┬─────┘    └────┬─────┘    └────┬─────┘    └────┬─────┘\n       ↑                                               │\n       └──────────────── 反馈循环 ←────────────────────┘\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>阶段一：感知（Perception）</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">工作内容：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">接收用户输入（自然语言指令）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">解析和意图识别（Intent Recognition）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">从环境获取当前状态（工具返回、系统状态）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">从 Memory 检索相关历史信息</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">perceive</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>user_input<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> MemorySystem<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> Perception<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"感知阶段：理解输入 + 检索上下文\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 1. 意图识别</span>\n    intent <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> llm_parse_intent<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>user_input<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 检索相关记忆</span>\n    relevant_memories <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>retrieve<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>user_input<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> top_k<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 获取环境状态（如有）</span>\n    env_state <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> get_environment_status<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> Perception<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n        <span class=\"token builtin\">raw_input</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span>user_input<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        intent<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>intent<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        context<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>relevant_memories<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        env_state<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>env_state\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>阶段二：规划（Planning）</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">工作内容：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">根据感知结果制定行动方案</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">将复杂目标分解为子任务（Task Decomposition）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">确定任务优先级和执行顺序</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">选择合适的工具链</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">plan</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>perception<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Perception<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> available_tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> Plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"规划阶段：制定行动方案\"\"\"</span>\n    prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"\"\"\n    目标：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>perception<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>intent<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>goal<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n    上下文：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>perception<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n    可用工具：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>available_tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n    \n    请制定执行计划，输出子任务列表（含工具选择）。\n    \"\"\"</span></span>\n    plan_text <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> call_llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    subtasks <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> parse_plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>plan_text<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> Plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>subtasks<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>subtasks<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> dependencies<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>analyze_dependencies<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>subtasks<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>阶段三：执行（Execution）</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">工作内容：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">按照计划逐步执行子任务</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">调用 Tools 与外部世界交互</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">收集工具返回结果（Observation）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">更新任务进度</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">execute_step</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> step_index<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> ToolRegistry<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> Observation<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"执行单个步骤\"\"\"</span>\n    step <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>subtasks<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>step_index<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># LLM 决策：选择工具和参数</span>\n    tool_call <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> llm_decide_tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>step<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get_schemas<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 执行工具</span>\n    result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>execute<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n        tool_name<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        params<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>parameters\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> Observation<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tool<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> result<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> status<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"success\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>阶段四：反思（Reflection）</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">工作内容：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">评估执行结果是否达到预期</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">检查是否有错误或偏差</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">决定：继续执行 / 重新规划 / 终止任务</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">从经验中学习，更新知识</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">reflect</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>observation<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Observation<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n            memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> MemorySystem<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> ReflectionResult<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"反思阶段：评估结果，决定下一步\"\"\"</span>\n    prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"\"\"\n    原计划：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n    执行结果：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>observation<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n    是否达成目标？是否有错误？是否需要调整计划？\n    \"\"\"</span></span>\n    reflection <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> call_llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> ReflectionResult<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n        is_complete<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>reflection<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>is_goal_achieved<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        needs_replan<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>reflection<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>has_errors<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        learnings<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>reflection<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>learnings  <span class=\"token comment\"># 经验总结</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>完整循环代码：</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Agent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">run</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> user_input<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 1. 感知</span>\n        perception <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>perceive<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>user_input<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 规划</span>\n        plan <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>perception<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        step <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">while</span> step <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>max_steps<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 执行</span>\n            observation <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>execute_step<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> step<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 4. 反思</span>\n            reflection <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>reflect<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>observation<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> reflection<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>is_complete<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate_final_answer<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> reflection<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>needs_replan<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                plan <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>replan<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> reflection<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 重新规划</span>\n            \n            step <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 存储中间结果到记忆</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>store_step<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>perception<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> observation<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> reflection<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"达到最大步数限制\"</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>数据流转示意：</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">用户输入 → [感知] 意图+上下文 → [规划] 子任务列表 \n    → [执行] 工具调用+观察结果 → [反思] 评估+决策\n        → 完成? → 输出答案\n        → 未完成? → [重新规划] → [执行] ... 循环\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>追问</strong>：循环的最大迭代次数应该设多少？如何防止死循环？</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>答</strong>：通常设 10-15 步。防死循环策略：①最大步数限制 ②检测重复动作 ③成本预算上限 ④超时机制</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>追问</strong>：反思阶段是必须的么？什么场景可以省略？</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>答</strong>：简单单步任务可省略；多步复杂任务必须保留，是 Agent 自我纠错和保证成功率的关键</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：四个阶段是严格顺序执行、每轮只执行一次</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：实际执行中可能多次执行-反思循环后才进入重新规划，阶段之间可能有交叉</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关\" dir=\"auto\">相关</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a> — 返回主题导航</li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}